# Source pictures under assets/ are third-party files kept byte-for-byte as
# downloaded, so the licence audit sees exactly what was published. No line
# ending translation.
assets/explore/** -text

# The molecule pictures are generated by scripts/molecule-images.mts, which
# writes LF. Git's autocrlf is on in this checkout, so without this every
# regeneration reports all twenty files as modified when nothing in them has
# changed — and "regenerate, then check the diff is empty" is the only way to
# verify the committed output still matches the script.
public/explore/molecules/** -text
